OL,9,G0855 Heir Hunters
OL,10,     FIn Dorset, the team race against
OL,11,     Ftime to unlock the history of a
OL,12,     Fsprawling family that includes a
OL,13,     Fformer naval police officer and an
OL,14,     Fever-growing list of hidden family
OL,15,     Fmembers.
OL,16,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,17,     FThe competition kicks off at the
OL,18,     F'self B&B' Bove Town House in
OL,19,     FGlastonbury, where Shannon
OL,20,     FSlater-Dent and Trevor Tredgett
OL,21,     Ftreat their guests to an afternoon
OL,22,     Fof group sound healing.
