OL,5,G1135 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe final visit is to The Fritton
OL,7,     FArms in Norfolk, where Ben
OL,8,     FDavenport and his partner Sian
OL,9,     FDewaal aspire to run the perfect
OL,10,     FB&B, but the fact that they allow
OL,11,     Fdogs to stay comes under fire.
OL,12,G1210 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day and the B&Bers
OL,14,     Fmeet for the last time to find out
OL,15,     Fhow much they've been paid.
OL,16,     FTensions run high as issues of
OL,17,     Fhygiene, noise and delayed
OL,18,     Fbreakfasts are raised.
