OL,5,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,6,     FIn Northern Ireland, young farmer
OL,7,     Fand architect Patrick hopes to
OL,8,     Fmake a home out of four large
OL,9,     Fshipping containers welded
OL,10,     Ftogether to form a giant cross.
OL,11,     FBut his budget is under threat.
OL,12,G2100 Bill Bailey's Vietnam
OL,13,     FBill goes deeper into ancient
OL,14,     Flocal tales, riding a junk boat
OL,15,     Fthrough the breathtakingly
OL,16,     Fbeautiful limestone karsts of Ha
OL,17,     FLong Bay, where legends of dragons
OL,18,     Flive on. (Ep6)
